    <bpmn:process id="W_W2860" name="W2860. Vaccine &amp; Immunization Program (Flu, Hep-B, Tetanus, COVID)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual cycle or public-health event
Frequency: Annual + event-driven
Volume: ~6,932 employees
Owner: OH Nurse Manager
Participants: OH Nurse, HR, HMO, DOH/LGU
Source: workflow W2860 — Vaccine &amp; Immunization Program (Flu, Hep-B, Tetanus, COVID)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2860_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2860_Lane1" name="OH Nurse Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2860_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2860_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2860_Lane2" name="OH Nurse">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2860_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2860_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2860_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2860_Start4" name="Annual cycle or public-health event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2860_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2860_Task5" name="OH Nurse Manager designs immunization program per role risk: Hep-B for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: OH Nurse Manager designs immunization program per role risk: Hep-B for first-aiders/handlers, tetanus for construction/yard, flu for customer-facing, COVID per DOH guidance
Responsible (R): OH Nurse Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2860_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2860_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2860_Task6" name="OH Nurse administers vaccines (or coordinates with LGU/HMO); records in…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: OH Nurse administers vaccines (or coordinates with LGU/HMO); records in immunization registry; manages cold-chain
Responsible (R): OH Nurse
Accountable (A): OH Nurse Manager
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2860_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2860_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2860_Task7" name="OH Nurse reports immunization coverage to DOH where required; tracks adverse…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: OH Nurse reports immunization coverage to DOH where required; tracks adverse events; updates registry
